---
import FlowShot from '../FlowShot.astro';
import FlowDetail from '../FlowDetail.astro';
import FlowShot from '../../../components/flow/FlowShot.astro';
import FlowDetail from '../../../components/flow/FlowDetail.astro';
import shotSearch from '../../../assets/flow/shots/flow-search-shot.webp';
import detailSearch from '../../../assets/flow/details/detail-search.webp';
---
<!-- Chapter 6: Search -->
<section class="border-t border-border/60 bg-surface-raised/30 px-6 py-14 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="tour-search">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-14">
    <div>
      <p class="of-eyebrow" data-animate="rise">Search</p>
      <h3 id="tour-search" class="of-display scroll-mt-28 mt-4 text-[clamp(1.85rem,3.4vw,2.75rem)]" data-animate="lead">A search result is a citation, not a guess.</h3>
      <p class="of-lede mt-5" data-animate="rise">
        Every result carries an anchor into the exact bytes you wrote. Opening it scrolls to one
        highlighted passage, after Flow re-checks, byte for byte, that the passage is still there.
        If your document changed, Flow finds the moved passage again. If it is gone, Flow says so
        instead of highlighting the wrong thing.
      </p>
      <ul class="flow-list mt-5">
        <li>22.3 milliseconds at the 95th percentile on a 10,000-note library. First full index in 1.1 seconds.</li>
        <li>A filename match can never masquerade as content. Structurally.</li>
        <li>Open, unsaved edits are indexed live and always win over the on-disk copy.</li>
        <li>Everything on-device. Nothing is sent over the network.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <!-- The search column is TALL and narrow, so it gets its own portrait
         crop beside the window rather than an overlay: a result list is
         only convincing if you can read the citations in it. -->
    <div class="flow-search-media" data-animate="plate">
      <FlowShot
        src={shotSearch}
        alt="Flow search across the demo library: results with abstracts, folder-qualified paths, and match reasons, beside two open documents."
        crop
        sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 30rem, 100vw"
      />
      <FlowDetail
        src={detailSearch}
        alt="Flow's search column: the query 'verification tax', eight results, each with an abstract, a folder-qualified path, and a match reason naming the exact line."
        caption="Every result carries its path and its line"
        sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 14rem, 45vw"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
